</font><strong><font color=\"#000000\">폐강과목 수강신청자의 경우 </font><font color=\"#0055ff\">수강료 납부 불가</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (<strong><font color=\"#6600ff\">12월 10(월)까지 수강정정신청서 제출한 경우&nbsp;11일(화) 수강료 납부가능/</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#6600ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 이후 제출의 경우 별도의 수강료 납부 기간 재공지</font>)&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">[첨부] 1. 폐강과목 내역</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2. 폐강과목 수강정정신청서</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">겨울계절수업 수강료 납부안내</font></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">. 납부기간 :</span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"> <font color=\"#7c84ef\"><font color=\"#0055ff\">2012. 12. 7(금) 09:00 - 12. 11(화)</font>&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#0055ff\">16:00 은행마감시간</font>까지</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#000000\">3일간</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotu